    21|/** Rork toolkit fallback was permanently removed on 2026-07-16 by owner directive.
    22| * The IVX provider chain is exclusively owner-controlled: OpenAI direct + Anthropic direct.
    23| * No Rork proxy, no Rork credits, no Rork AI Cloud dependency. */
    24|export type IVXProviderFailureClass =
